From: Nguyen Phan <nguyen@nguyenphan.org>
Date: Mon, 10 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] dsv41: publish prompt-pass progress

/metrics adds prompt_tokens_computed_total (monotone prompt tokens computed since the process
started), prefill_streams (passes open) and prefill_age_ms (how old the oldest is). The counter is an
atomic on the backend's side, so a scrape takes a delta without touching the engine thread's lists —
and the delta is the pass speed while the engine thread is inside a long pass, which is exactly when
a client sees silence.
